+## Sites
+
+Send the site id in the `X-Larder-Site` header. It defaults to `main`.
+An unknown id returns HTTP 400 with error code `unknown_site`. Batches,
+on-hand quantities, cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use the
+selected kitchen. Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
